<title>MEXICO: Elektra Q1 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Elektra Q1 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997		     Q1 1996</p>
<p>	Shr		n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>	Net		168.52 million	     255.72 million</p>
<p>	Revs	     1.181 bln		793.03 million</p>
<p>	Oper Income    170.81 million	     64.20 million</p>
<p>	Integ fin gain 22.42 million		98.41 million</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	  Full company name is Grupo Elektra SA</p>
